OL,3,GNEWSAFatality fears over cars speeding
OL,4,Athrough village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is being urged to crack down
OL,7,Fon motorists who race through a
OL,8,Fvillage, at more than double to 30mph
OL,9,Flimit before "someone gets killed".
OL,11,FResidents have said there are a lack of
OL,12,Fsigns, safety measures or deterrents on
OL,13,Fthe roads leading into and through
OL,14,FEasington Village in County Durham.
OL,16,FThe BBC found a 30mph sign at an entry
OL,17,Fpoint to the village had fallen down,
OL,18,Fwhich locals claimed had been left
OL,19,Flying at the roadside since January.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
