OL,3,GNEWSAFatality fears over cars speeding
OL,4,Athrough village
OL,5,
OL,6,FDurham County Council said it would
OL,7,F"consider" a request for further safety
OL,8,Fmeasures to be implemented based on
OL,9,Fnational guidelines and regulations.
